namespace pdg { /**
\fn NetServer pdg::NetServer::listen(function callback)
\brief Start configured listeners and receive authenticated PDG connections.

Calls callback(connection) after the PDG key and version handshake. Return true
to accept the connection; a false return or exception closes it. Native and
WebSocket connections use this same callback. Call ready() to observe startup;
see \ref websocket_server_options for listener settings and rollback behavior.

\param callback Function receiving a NetConnection and returning whether to accept it.
\return This NetServer for chaining.
\see ready(), NetConnection, shutdown()
**/ }
